---
import { GISCUS } from '../consts';

const ready = Boolean(GISCUS.repo && GISCUS.repoId);
const cfg = { ...GISCUS };
---

<section class="comments">
  <h2>评论</h2>
  {
    ready ? (
      <>
        <div class="giscus" />
        <script define:vars={{ cfg }}>
          const attrs = {
            'data-repo': cfg.repo,
            'data-repo-id': cfg.repoId,
            'data-category': cfg.category,
            'data-category-id': cfg.categoryId,
            'data-mapping': cfg.mapping,
            'data-lang': cfg.lang,
            'data-reactions-enabled': '1',
            'data-emit-metadata': '0',
            'data-input-position': 'top',
            'data-theme': 'light',
            'data-loading': 'lazy',
          };
          const s = document.createElement('script');
          s.src = 'https://giscus.app/client.js';
          s.async = true;
          s.crossOrigin = 'anonymous';
          Object.entries(attrs).forEach(([k, v]) => s.setAttribute(k, v));
          document.querySelector('.giscus')?.appendChild(s);
        </script>
      </>
    ) : (
      <div class="comment-hint">
        评论区尚未启用。在 <code>src/consts.ts</code> 中填写 <code>GISCUS.repo</code> 与
        <code>GISCUS.repoId</code> 后，评论框会出现在这里。<br />
        步骤：仓库 Settings → Features 勾选 Discussions → 打开 giscus.app 授权并生成配置。
      </div>
    )
  }
</section>
